# Business Skills Platform — Cursor AI Rules

> **Read first:** `docs/AI_QUICKSTART.md` → `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` → task-relevant files only.
> Do **not** scan the whole repo. Legacy rule `eduwork-platform.mdc` is superseded by this file.

## Project Identity

- **Official name:** Business Skills · **Short:** BS Platform · **Legacy:** EduWork
- Arabic-first, RTL-first; English supported (`next-intl`, `src/locales/`)
- Stack: Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, Supabase, shadcn/ui
- Do **not** reintroduce EduWork branding in user-facing copy unless updating legacy references
- Internal package/db keys may still use `eduwork` — intentional (`src/lib/brand/constants.ts`)

## Token-Saving Workflow

1. Read `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` and `docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md` before large tasks
2. Open **only** files relevant to the request:
   - **Auth/RBAC:** `src/lib/auth/`, `src/proxy.ts`, `docs/auth-claims-rbac.md`
   - **Video:** `src/lib/video/`, `src/lib/video-providers/`, playback API routes, player components
   - **UI:** specific page/component + `src/lib/brand/constants.ts` for branding
   - **DB:** relevant `supabase/migrations/` + typed helpers in `src/lib/`
   - **Branding:** `src/components/brand/`, `globals.css`, metadata, Navbar/Footer/Auth
3. For large features, consult or create docs under `docs/` first

## Core Coding Standards

- TypeScript strictly — no `any`; types in `src/types/`
- App Router only (`src/app/`); components in `src/components/`
- `async/await`; handle loading, error, empty states
- i18n keys only — never hardcode UI strings
- shadcn/ui first; Tailwind only — no inline styles or separate CSS files
- Typed Supabase selects; never ignore `error`; RLS-aware queries
- Prefer small, safe, incremental changes; inspect relevant files before editing

## Security (non-negotiable)

- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to the client
- Never use `user_metadata` for authorization
- `public.users` is source of truth for role/status; JWT `app_metadata` is cached projection
- Prefer JWT `app_metadata` claims for proxy RBAC (`src/proxy.ts`, `src/lib/auth/proxy-rbac.ts`)
- Never bypass RLS casually; privileged routes fail safe when role cannot be proven
- Route handlers must validate auth/role; inactive users → `/account-suspended`

## Video

- Use provider abstraction (`src/lib/video-providers/`)
- Vimeo for high-traffic delivery; R2 for advanced/custom/backup
- Do **not** move heavy video bytes through Next.js unless explicitly required
- Preserve playback sessions, watermark, and AES/HLS protection logic

## UI & Branding

- Colors: orange `#E57D17` (primary/action), teal `#045F6B` (growth/verified/success)
- BS logo: vector SVG (`/logo-traced.svg`), not raster
- Mobile: design mobile-first; video + lesson nav first; AI secondary
- No icons-only controls without labels on mobile; preserve accessibility and RTL

## Verification After Edits

Run or recommend: `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run lint`
If full-repo lint has pre-existing errors, report separately and confirm changed files are clean.
Preserve existing test/typecheck behavior.
